{"last_link_id": 41, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": [" - [S1]哈喽，AI时代的冲浪先锋们！欢迎收听《AI生活进行时》。啊，一个充满了未来  感，然后，还有一点点，<|laughter|>神经质的播客节目，我是主持人小希。\n - [S2]哎，大家好呀！我是能唠，爱唠，天天都想唠的唠嗑！\n - [S1]最近活得特别赛博朋克哈！以前觉得AI是科幻片里的，<|sigh|> 现在，现在连我妈都用AI写广场舞文案了。\n - [S2]<|laughter|>这个例子很生动啊。是的，特别是生成式AI哈，感觉都要炸了！ 诶，那我们今天就聊聊AI<|breathing|>AI是怎么走进我们的生活的哈！\n - [S1]没错。\n - [S2]<|coughing|>，比如ChatGPT的写作能力啊，我有个程序员朋友，现在用ChatGPT三分钟<|breathing|>三分钟就能写出感情充沛的周报，<|laughter|>把老板都看傻了都。\n\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [750, 160], "pos": [222.12115478515625, 1283.0223388671875], "id": 15, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": ["# 🌈              资源说明            🌈\n---\n# ⭐所有免费资源⭐\n## 👉[免费资源](https://wxuyk58beb5.feishu.cn/docx/TJF1dpepNoHtsMxP5MfcNJhnnSf) 👈点击跳转（整合包/公开课/云端）\n\n---\n\n## [工作流和资料免费分享](https://pan.quark.cn/s/d588a76afc19)👈点击跳转\n（可按日期和名称寻找所需工作流或者模型）\n\n---\n\n# 🦁大炮满血整合包下载地址🦁\n## 👉[满血整合包](https://wxuyk58beb5.feishu.cn/docx/TJF1dpepNoHtsMxP5MfcNJhnnSf) 👈点击跳转\n（含模型和环境包 300+工作流一键直出）\n\n---\n\n# 🌈跑不动的可以考虑用我的云端🌈\n\n## 👉[仙宫满血云端](https://www.xiangongyun.com/image/detail/5b5aa403-8e9c-4a81-94a3-ce9a13febb47)👈点击跳转\n\n## ⭐RH平台也有我大部分工作流：\n\n## 👉[RH最新工作流](https://www.runninghub.cn/user-center/1843821604546498561/userPost?inviteCode=kol01-rh138)👈点击跳转\n\n\n---\n\n## ⭐如果需要VIP云端也可联系我\n## 👉[所有工作流展示效果](https://wxuyk58beb5.feishu.cn/docx/IZSadNNb0oqF9rxGw97cQQSgnUo)👈点击查看\n\n---\n\n# 🎥我的所有视频🎥\n## -- 💻[bilibili](https://space.bilibili.com/397686377?spm_id_from=333.33.0.0)👈点击跳转 -- 💻[抖音](https://www.douyin.com/user/MS4wLjABAAAAHSDoiXKglmJvAqDOrjZONAx42I_BGnbcHX51hStBIw_LJILooUMeI2Had3Xp5xW2?from_tab_name=main&vid=7517850368684903717)👈点击跳转\n\n---\n\n# 🥩我的B站comfyui免费课🥩\n## -- 🍱[保姆级comfyui入门公开课](https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1rP7uzpEvC/?vd_source=2102d46b60c3ac89745322229c864c92)👈点击跳转\n# 🥘本工作流演示说明🥘\n\n## -- 🥨[大炮B站主页](https://space.bilibili.com/397686377)👈点击跳转\n\n## 💫需要VIP永久报错服务或购买专属课可以私我💫\n\n---\n\n## 🐧请联系VX：paolaoshiAICG🐧\n---\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "大炮工作流使用说明", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [512.5709228515625, 774.7727661132812], "pos": [-447.1795349121094, 1357.431640625], "id": 26, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [], "label": "文本", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "显示帮助", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [606.2838745117188, 221.3872833251953], "pos": [166.87648010253906, 2172.65185546875], "widgets_values": ["[S1] 哈啰大家好啊，欢迎收听我哋慨节目。喂，我今日想问你样嘢啊，你觉唔觉得，嗯，而家揸电动车，最烦，最烦慨一样嘢系咩啊？\n\n[S1] 系咪先。如果我而家同你讲，充电可以快到同入油差唔多时间，你信唔信先？喂你平时喺油站入满一缸油，要几耐啊？五六分钟？\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 23, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_Comfyroll_CustomNodes", "ver": "d78b780ae43fcf8c6b7c6505e6ffb4584281ceca", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "PODCAST_INPUT", "links": [27], "label": "PODCAST_INPUT", "type": "PODCAST_INPUT", "localized_name": "PODCAST_INPUT"}], "size": [420, 440], "pos": [564.4732055664062, 1523.4271240234375], "widgets_values": ["simple", "[S1]<|Yue|>哇！大炮哥哥，你睇下阿里最新推出嘅呢个TTS开源项目，叫做SoulX-Podcast，真系令人眼前一亮！\n[S2]<|Sichuan|>哦？阿里又搞啥子大动作咯？它有啥子特别之处嘛？\n[S1]<|Yue|><|sigh|>最劲嘅系，佢唔单止讲得多种方言，仲可以表达唔同情绪添，真系做到以假乱真！\n[S2]<|Sichuan|><|laughter|>哎哟喂！这简直是神仙操作撒！太厉害了！", "{}"], "inputs": [{"name": "soulx_model", "link": 24, "label": "soulx_model", "type": "SOULX_MODEL", "localized_name": "soulx_model"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "S1_prompt_audio", "link": 39, "label": "S1_prompt_audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "S1_prompt_audio"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "S2_prompt_audio", "link": 32, "label": "S2_prompt_audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "S2_prompt_audio"}, {"widget": {"na